# 第二十三部　首批应冻结的定理

最适合立即进入项目真源的结果是：

$$
\boxed{
\widehat{e^{-ax^2}}=e^{-ax^2}
\iff
a=\pi.
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
2\int_0^\infty
e^{-\pi x^2}x^{s-1}\,dx
=
\pi^{-s/2}\Gamma(s/2).
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
E(x+y)=E(x)E(y),\ E'(0)=1
\Longrightarrow
E(x)=e^x.
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
x=1+\frac1x,\ x>0
\iff
x=\varphi.
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
e^{-\ell_p(p)}=p^{-1}
\iff
\ell_p(p)=\log p.
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
H_n-\log n-\gamma\to0.
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
s=1-\overline s
\iff
\Re(s)=\frac12.
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
S(x)+T(x)
=
\sqrt{\frac{\pi e^x}{2x}}.
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
\int_0^\infty
t^{w-1}\mathcal L_{p,r}(t)\,dt
=
\Gamma(w)\zeta(w)\zeta(w+r)(1-p^{-w-r}).
}
$$

$$
\boxed{
Z_\varphi(s)
\text{ 亚纯延拓至 }\Re(s)>0,
\qquad
\operatorname*{Res}_{s=1}Z_\varphi(s)=\frac1{\sqrt5}.
}
$$

